{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 87,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "His foundation is in the holy mountains.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华所立的根基在圣山上。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華所立的根基在聖山上。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD loves the gates of Zion more than all the dwellings of Jacob.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他爱的门， 一切的住处。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他愛的門， 一切的住處。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "Glorious things are spoken about you, city of God. Selah.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神的城啊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝的城啊，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will record Rahab and Babylon among those who acknowledge me. Behold, Philistia, Tyre, and also Ethiopia: This one was born there.”",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "87:4 Rahab is a reference to Egypt."
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我要提起和人， 和并人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我要提起和人， 和並人，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "Yes, of Zion it will be said, “This one and that one was born in her;” the Most High himself will establish her.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "论到，必说：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "論到，必說：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD will count, when he writes up the peoples, This one was born there.” Selah.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "当耶和华记录万民的时候，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "當耶和華記錄萬民的時候，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "Those who sing as well as those who dance say, All my springs are in you.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "歌唱的，跳舞的，都：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "歌唱的，跳舞的，都：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}